WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:02.484
"Dig in!" cried Rat.

2
00:00:02.485 --> 00:00:05.913
Everyone around the table started to eat. No

3
00:00:05.914 --> 00:00:09.654
one was shy about passing plates. All

4
00:00:09.655 --> 00:00:13.104
the food was tasty. "Hey, Mole,"

5
00:00:13.105 --> 00:00:16.096
said one little mouse. "Did you

6
00:00:16.097 --> 00:00:18.542
hear about the swamp?" "No," said

7
00:00:18.543 --> 00:00:21.845
Mole. "What happened?" "It dried up,"

8
00:00:21.846 --> 00:00:25.488
