13
00:00:37.656 --> 00:00:41.730
He never stops building." All

14
00:00:41.731 --> 00:00:44.008
through dinner, Rat did

15
00:00:44.009 --> 00:00:48.110
not say much. He just smiled and ate. "Well,

16
00:00:48.111 --> 00:00:52.900
