24
00:01:22.707 --> 00:01:44.519
joy in the morning! You will have

25
00:01:44.520 --> 00:01:47.914
joy in the morning! Rat and Mole

26
00:01:47.915 --> 00:01:53.654
watched them leave. The mice’s lantern light faded

27
00:01:53.655 --> 00:01:59.690
behind the hill. "Ratty, I’m going to bed,"

28
00:01:59.691 --> 00:02:03.993
yawned Mole. "Is it nice to be home?"

29
00:02:03.994 --> 00:02:07.179
asked Rat. "Oh yes,"

30
00:02:07.180 --> 00:02:10.459
sighed Mole. "It’s also nice by the river with

31
00:02:10.460 --> 00:02:13.982
you." "Ah, the river," said

32
00:02:13.983 --> 00:02:21.758
